    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"exit gracefully\" and \"starting a new instance\"... that sounds a lot like just terminating the process. but if the process is terminated, there is no new instance. there's just nothing. just a clean wipe of the drive. if the only way to fix the noise is to stop the execution entirely, isn't that just... deleting the file?",
